  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IFRC - Toward Stronger Humanitarian Action in Africa through Advancing Effective Establishment and Operationalization of African Humanitarian Agency</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Danish contribution of DKK 800.000 to the International Federation of the Red Cross and Red Crescent Societies&#x2019; (IFRC) and the programme &#x201c;Toward Stronger Humanitarian Action in Africa through Advancing Effective Establishment and Operationalization of African Humanitarian Agency&#x201d;. The programme is expected to be supported by Denmark, Norway, and Sweden. Through financial support the IFRC will engage with the AU Commission, the Humanitarian Division of Health, Humanitarian and Social Affairs Department and support the establishment of African Humanitarian Agency (AfHA). The Danish support will be earmarked to a (i) Senior Program Officer and (ii) Technical Support to develop relevant policies under AfHA and support in alignment with other AU policies.</narrative>
  </description>
